      "writtenOn": "2024-08-06T00:50:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have already implemented .queuecommand(), but some of our custom modifications also involve the block layer. By hooking scsi_execute, we can customize the requests coming from submit_bio and the SCSI driver. thx~",
